    {
      "bbox": [
        285,
        1449,
        1462,
        1643
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 4. Amendments. Amendment to this Order that\ntransfers the functions, powers and duties of the Public\nUtility Service to any other City agency shall be submitted\nto the City Council and shall be subject to the action\nof that body in accordance with the provisions of \u00a711(c)\nof the City Charter.",
